OL,3,AMajor travel disruption and thousands
OL,4,Awithout power as Storm Austen hits UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FStorm Austen is causing widespread
OL,7,Fpower cuts and travel disruption ` with
OL,8,Fwind gusts of 84mph (135km/h) recorded
OL,9,Fat Jersey Airport
OL,11,FMore than 18,000 homes in parts of
OL,12,FEngland and Wales are without power, as
OL,13,Fmillions remain under a yellow weather
OL,14,Fwarning for wind - here's a recap of
OL,15,Fthe disruption
OL,17,FIn Brighton, a section of the iconic
OL,18,FWest Pier has collapsed. One local says
OL,19,Fhe is "shocked by the amount of pier
OL,20,Fthat's ended up in the sea"
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/40
