OL,3,ASeven shot dead by gunmen at church
OL,4,Afuneral in Jordan, officials say
OL,5,
OL,6,FJordan's King Abdullah II said the
OL,7,Fauthorities would "confront the
OL,8,Fterrorist act that targeted Karak with
OL,9,Fthe harshest penalties."
