OL,3,AIsraeli forces begin demolishing
OL,4,APalestinian buildings in Hebron after
OL,5,Atwo Israeli soldiers shot dead
OL,6,
OL,7,FThree other soldiers were wounded in
OL,8,Fthe attack at a checkpoint outside
OL,9,FHebron, before the gunmen were shot
OL,10,Fdead, officials say.
OL,12,FIt comes at a time of high tensions,
OL,13,Fwith extremist Jewish settlers
OL,14,Ftargeting Palestinians during the
OL,15,Fannual olive harvest, and Israel's
OL,16,Fgeneral election taking place in four
OL,17,Fdays' time.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/40
