OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AWhite House says Melania Trump brokers
OL,4,Atruce for Ukraine city 'on brink of
OL,5,Adisaster'
OL,6,
OL,7,F"Oleshky's remaining population is
OL,8,Fcomprised primarily of elderly
OL,9,Fresidents who urgently need medical
OL,10,Fattention, medicine, food, and clean
OL,11,Fwater," it added. Ukraine and Russia
OL,12,Flater confirmed the ceasefire was
OL,13,Fagreed.
OL,15,FOleshky, in the Kherson region, was
OL,16,Fseized by Russian forces during the
OL,17,Ffirst days of Moscow's full-scale
OL,18,Finvasion in February 2022. Remaining
OL,19,Fresidents have recently resorted to
OL,20,Feating garden weeds to survive.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/40
